  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ul><li><span><span style=\"color: rgb(50,50,50);\">活动期间，设置5钻的星梦之约礼物，用户每次送出可有机会获得10钻/21钻/52钻//520钻礼物送给直接送给主播</span></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(50,50,50);\">用户每次送出礼物可同时获得星盘碎片*1个，用户可在活动页面中使用星盘碎片机会不同星盘解锁礼物奖励，礼物下发至背包。</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(50,50,50);\">5钻送礼玩法：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">触发520钻礼物时触发全站悬浮公聊：</span><p><span style=\"color: rgb(163,21,21);\">【星梦之约】用户昵称为主播昵称送出星梦之约礼物，触发暴击，为主播送出礼物名称！快去围观～</span></p></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\">触发不同礼物时触发直播间公聊 仅自己可见：</span></span><p><span style=\"color: rgb(163,21,21);\">【星梦之约】恭喜宝宝成功触发暴击，为主播昵称送出礼物名称！</span></p></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(50,50,50);\"><strong>批量要1个1个消费</strong></span></span></span></span></li></ul><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>礼物名称</td><td>礼物价格</td><td>礼物ID</td><td><br /></td><td>URL</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星梦之约</td><td>5</td><td>　24232</td><td>送出该礼物主播获得1映币，剩余参与玩法，最高可获得520热力值</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MzcxNTYzNTM2MiMzNTYjcG5n.png\" class=\"\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MzcxNTYzNTM2MiMzNTYjcG5n.png</a></td><td>GIF，连送，主播获得1映币</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">您申请的SourceType: [增加映币-赠送-平台运营组-全明星-5钻玩法专用-2026-03-13] 已经审批完成</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">SourceType:<span>&nbsp;</span></span><strong>766</strong><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">您申请的操作对象为：映币，请把对应的soucetype提供给&ldquo;主播运营组(礼物墙管理)&rdquo;，用于配置背包礼物；</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">起始时间：2026-03-13 15:34:46</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">结束时间：2026-04-20 15:35:33</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">APP账单记录文案：直播收入</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">是否计入送礼流水：是</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">是否计入基准流水：是</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">是否计入无背包基准映币：否</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">否计入实际映币收入：是</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">是否为赠送钻石：否</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">SourceType Hash:<span>&nbsp;</span></span><strong>c6bf7191d33b6492baf7825d52ca26ae</strong><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(33,33,33);\">* HASH使用时请保持小写，请及时关注SourceType预警邮件。</span></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>礼物名称</td><td>礼物价格</td><td>礼物ID</td><td>备注</td><td>URL</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>流光谒夜</td><td>10</td><td>24172</td><td>直送礼物</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTQ4NTc5NDUwNyM1MzUjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTQ4NTc5NDUwNyM1MzUjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星河灯塔</td><td>21</td><td>24173</td><td>直送礼物</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2MjMwODU5MzUxMSMgNTgjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2MjMwODU5MzUxMSMgNTgjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>梦幻婚纱</td><td>52</td><td>24174</td><td>直送礼物</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYxMjUxNDQyMDQzMSM2NDcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYxMjUxNDQyMDQzMSM2NDcjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星落冰堡</td><td>520</td><td>24175</td><td>直送礼物</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MzM5NjQ0MDUzNiMgOTMjcG5n.png\"><strong>https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MzM5NjQ0MDUzNiMgOTMjcG5n.png</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>指定礼物价格</td><td>10钻</td><td>21钻</td><td>52钻</td><td>520钻</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255,0,0);\">礼物名称</span></strong></td><td><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255,0,0);\">流光谒夜</span></strong></td><td><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255,0,0);\">星河灯塔</span></strong></td><td><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255,0,0);\">梦幻婚纱</span></strong></td><td><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255,0,0);\">星落冰堡</span></strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255,0,0);\">礼物ID</span></strong>